              "segment": {
                "start_index": 738,
                "end_index": 894,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Common obstructions include:\n*   **Enlarged Prostate (BPH):** In men, the prostate gland surrounds the urethra (the tube that carries urine out of the body)"
