              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1056,
                "end_index": 1214,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "*   **Pelvic Organ Prolapse:** In women, pelvic floor muscles can weaken, causing the bladder or uterus to sag and press against the urethra, pinching it shut"
